idle-daemon (3.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Remove dead gpu_enabled flag end-to-end (GPU upscaler deleted in 2026;
    D-Bus SetGpuEnabled stays a deprecated no-op, config key ignored)
  * Fix watchdog stall: exits non-zero so Restart=on-failure actually restarts
  * Cap plugin runner memory via cgroup memory.max (default 2 GiB)
  * Check manifest entry before first plugin call (tighter load ordering)
  * Soften self-update repoquery-miss messaging
  * Add D-Bus validation + config parser fuzz tests; serialize remaining
    env-mutating tests under the shared ENV_LOCK

